<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Order Raspberry Pie</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f7f7f7;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        section {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .btn-order {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            color: white;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .img-pie {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Order Your Raspberry Pie</h1>
    </header>
    <section>
        <h2>Welcome to our Raspberry Pie Ordering Site!</h2>
        <img src="raspberry_pie_image1.jpg" alt="Delicious Raspberry Pie" class="img-pie">
        <p>Craving a delicious homemade raspberry pie? You've come to the right place! Just click the button below to place your order:</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn-order">Order Now</a>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <img src="raspberry_pie_image2.jpg" alt="Fresh Raspberry Pie" class="img-pie">
        <p>We bake the freshest raspberry pies using only the finest ingredients. Each pie is made to order, ensuring you get the best quality every time.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <img src="raspberry_pie_image3.jpg" alt="Yummy Raspberry Pie" class="img-pie">
        <p>Got questions? Reach out to us at <a href="mailto:info@raspberrypie.com">info@raspberrypie.com</a></p>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
